(Section 2: Annual leave) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Full-time employees receive 27 days of annual leave per year,) Tj T*
(in addition to public bank holidays.) Tj T*
(Part-time employees receive a pro-rata entitlement.) Tj T*
(Up to 5 unused days may be carried over into the next leave year.) Tj T*
(Carried-over days must be taken by 31 March, or they are lost.) Tj T*
(Leave requests need manager approval at least two weeks in advance.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
