(Section 3: Expenses) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Business mileage in a private car is reimbursed at 45p per mile) Tj T*
(for the first 10,000 miles in a tax year, and 25p per mile after that.) Tj T*
(Claims must be submitted within 60 days with receipts attached.) Tj T*
(Hotel stays are capped at 140 pounds per night outside London.) Tj T*
ET
